eport,\n","    ConfusionMatrixDisplay\n",")\n","\n","from IPython.display import display\n","\n","# Make pandas show more columns on screen\n","pd.set_option(\"display.max_columns\", 50)\n","pd.set_option(\"display.width\", 120)\n","\n","sns.set_theme(style=\"whitegrid\", palette=\"Set2\")\n","plt.rcParams[\"figure.figsize\"] = (10, 5)\n","plt.rcParams[\"axes.titlesize\"] = 14\n","plt.rcParams[\"axes.labelsize\"] = 11\n","\n","print(\"✅ All libraries imported successfully. You are ready.\")\n","print(\"If you saw no error above, go to the next cell.\")\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"3fdb61a2","metadata":{"id":"3fdb61a2"},"source":["## Cell 2 — Load the dataset from the internet\n","\n","We use `pd.read_csv(url)` so you do **not** have to upload a file.\n","\n","If the first website is down, the code automatically tries a backup URL.\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":2,"id":"910c4c98","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":434},"id":"910c4c98","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1787223330729,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":1407,"user":{"displayName":"Aryan Choudhary","userId":"07944419665814199827"}},"outputId":"a156b141-03bd-4d24-e541-eaa4a523c5cb"},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Loaded data from:\n"," https://raw.githubusercontent.com/matheusduzzi/projeto_RH/main/WA_Fn-UseC_-HR-Employee-Attrition.csv\n","\n","Shape of the table (rows, columns): (1470, 35)\n","That means we have 1470 employees and 35 pieces of information about each of them.\n","\n","First 5 rows (like the top of an Excel sheet):\n"]},{"output_type":"execute_result","data":{"text/plain":["   Age Attrition     BusinessTravel  DailyRate              Department  DistanceFromHome  Education EducationField  \\\n","0   41       Yes      Travel_Rarely       1102                   Sales                 1          2  Life Sciences   \n","1   49        No  Travel_Frequently        279  Research & Development                 8          1  L