feature engineering → unsupervised exploration → models → metrics → business insight**.\n","\n","### Honest limitation (saying this makes you look senior, not junior)\n","\n","- The dataset is **fictional (IBM)**, not a live company extract.\n","- 1,470 rows is small; real HR models need more history and time-based validation.\n","- We used a random split, not a time split (the data has no true calendar dates).\n","- Class imbalance was handled with `class_weight`, not with advanced resampling.\n","\n","You do **not** need a fancier algorithm for a beginner–intermediate resume.  \n","You need a **clean story, correct metrics, and the ability to explain bias–variance**. This notebook is that.\n"]}],"metadata":{"colab":{"provenance":[]},"kernelspec":{"display_name":"Python 3","language":"python","name":"python3"},"language_info":{"name":"python","pygments_lexer":"ipython3"}},"nbformat":4,"nbformat_minor":5}
